CharDnD API Endpoints

Routes are grouped by the backend service responsible for the work.
The /API prefix matches App.py. {id} values are resource IDs.

Status:
    Existing = route is currently registered in App.py.
    Planned  = route is a proposed endpoint and still needs implementation.
    All routes under "Planned services" are planned and are not yet in App.py.

CharacterService
    POST   /API/characters/creator                         - Existing: create a character, including creation choices.
    GET    /API/characters                                 - Existing: list characters.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}                             - Existing: get the character and its sheet data.
    PATCH  /API/characters/{id}                             - Planned: edit character details, scores, and other sheet values.
    DELETE /API/characters/{id}                             - Existing: delete a character.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/classes/{classID}/resources - Existing: view a character class's tracked resources.
    PATCH  /API/characters/{id}/classes/{classID}/resources/{resourceType} - Existing: update a tracked class resource.
    POST   /API/characters/{id}/rest                         - Existing: take a short or long rest.
    POST   /API/characters/{id}/copies                      - Planned: duplicate a character.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/exports/pdf                 - Planned: export a character sheet as PDF.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/exports                     - Planned: export a character in another supported format.
    POST   /API/characters/imports                           - Planned: import a character.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/history                     - Planned: view activity or versions (use ?type=activity|versions).
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/portraits                    - Planned: list character portraits.
    POST   /API/characters/{id}/portraits                    - Planned: add a character portrait.
    DELETE /API/characters/{id}/portraits/{portraitID}       - Planned: remove a character portrait.
    POST   /API/characters/{id}/shares                       - Planned: share a character with another user.
    DELETE /API/characters/{id}/shares/{shareID}             - Planned: revoke a character share.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/stats/derived                - Planned: get calculated statistics not stored on the character.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/proficiencies               - Planned: view the character's proficiencies.
    PUT    /API/characters/{id}/proficiencies               - Planned: set the character's proficiencies.
    POST   /API/characters/{id}/level-ups                    - Planned: apply a level-up and its choices.
    GET    /API/characters/{id}/progression                 - Planned: view level and experience progression.
    PATCH  /API/characters/{id}/progression                 - Planned: update class levels, feats, and progression choices.

