    POST   /API/auth/login                                  - Log in.
    POST   /API/auth/logout                                 - Log out.
    GET    /API/accounts/me                                 - Get the signed-in account.
    PATCH  /API/accounts/me                                 - Edit account details.
    PUT    /API/accounts/me/password                        - Change password.
    POST   /API/auth/password-resets                        - Request a password reset.
    PUT    /API/auth/password-resets/{token}                - Complete a password reset.
    DELETE /API/accounts/me                                 - Delete the signed-in account.

